{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "在那之后……", "steam": "那之后……"}, "length": {"chs": 6, "steam": 5}, "similarity": 0.857}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6762", "steam": "sn6762", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「呼、呼、再、再怎么说也够了吧，\\n　全身酥酥麻麻的而且也很害羞……」", "steam": "“嗯呼、嗯呼、真、真的够了啦、很痒，而且很羞耻……”"}, "length": {"chs": 35, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.48}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我们就这样脱了衣服洗了个澡，\\n然后直接钻进了被窝。", "steam": "我们脱下衣服清理身体，然后躺到床上依偎彼此。"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 22}, "similarity": 0.318}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "然后，我温柔地抱住了纱凪，\\n开始专心摸起她的头来。", "steam": "我温柔地抱着纱凪，抚摸着她的头。"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 16}, "similarity": 0.595}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "——至少现在得对她温柔些。", "steam": "──聊胜于无，倒也不是。"}, "length": {"chs": 13, "steam": 12}, "similarity": 0.0}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「嘴上这么说，却一点也不抵抗呢，纱凪」", "steam": "“虽然那样说，但你没有抵抗呢，纱凪。”"}, "length": {"chs": 19, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.414}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6763", "steam": "sn6763", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「还不是因为我被某人给迷得神魂颠倒了啊」", "steam": "“因为不知道是被谁弄得神魂颠倒嘛。”"}, "length": {"chs": 20, "steam": 18}, "similarity": 0.606}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6764", "steam": "sn6764", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「而且你一副很想摸的样子……\\n　我只是无可奈何，才让你摸的♪」", "steam": "“而且新吾看起来很想摸的样子……我是没办法才让你摸的喔♪”"}, "length": {"chs": 32, "steam": 29}, "similarity": 0.627}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6765", "steam": "sn6765", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……很舒服，而且让人安心」", "steam": "“……反正很舒服，又很放松。”"}, "length": {"chs": 14, "steam": 15}, "similarity": 0.333}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6766", "steam": "sn6766", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「啊……疼疼疼」", "steam": "“欸……好痛痛痛！”"}, "length": {"chs": 8, "steam": 10}, "similarity": 0.0}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「啊……纱凪、难道说……」", "steam": "“啊……纱凪、该不会……”"}, "length": {"chs": 13, "steam": 13}, "similarity": 0.571}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6767", "steam": "sn6767", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「抱歉……怎么说呢，身体稍微恢复了点力气，\\n　就不由得会注意到那里……」", "steam": "“抱歉……感觉身体好像恢复力气了，结果好像连那里都想起来……”"}, "length": {"chs": 37, "steam": 31}, "similarity": 0.423}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「……要道歉的是我啊」", "steam": "“……是我该说抱歉。”"}, "length": {"chs": 11, "steam": 11}, "similarity": 0.462}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6768", "steam": "sn6768", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「没什么好道歉的吧。刚刚也说过了，\\n　我们是互相都希望如此才做的」", "steam": "“你不用道歉没关系。就像我刚才说的，这是我们都想做的事。”"}, "length": {"chs": 34, "steam": 29}, "similarity": 0.491}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6769", "steam": "sn6769", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「女孩子第一次会痛是很正常的，\\n　也没办法啊」", "steam": "“女孩子的第一次会痛是自然的生理现象，没办法。”"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.65}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "……不过，要是我做得不那么激烈。", "steam": "……但是，如果我没有那么激烈的话。"}, "length": {"chs": 16, "steam": 17}, "similarity": 0.48}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我难以避免地这么想。", "steam": "我无法克制自己这样想。"}, "length": {"chs": 10, "steam": 11}, "similarity": 0.316}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "至少，在纱凪的疼痛缓解之前，\\n绝对不能做第二回……", "steam": "至少，在纱凪的痛楚痊愈之前，我绝对不能要求第二次……"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.682}
