{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "在纱凪主动渴求之前，我还是忍着吧。\\n总觉得我这边主动要求也不好。", "steam": "在纱凪开口要求之前我应该忍耐。我不能主动要求。"}, "length": {"chs": 33, "steam": 23}, "similarity": 0.549}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "要是我又失去理性变得和野兽一样，\\n然后被纱凪责备……这可不行……", "steam": "我不能又失去理性，像野兽一样……欺负纱凪……"}, "length": {"chs": 33, "steam": 22}, "similarity": 0.578}
