{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6771", "steam": "sn6771", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「你要是觉得只有自己舒服而感到抱歉，\n　那作为赔礼，就是……啾……啾」", "steam": "“如果你觉得男人只负责舒服很抱歉的话，与其道歉，那个……亲……亲我吧。”"}, "length": {"chs": 35, "steam": 36}, "similarity": 0.34}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「唔啾」", "steam": "“嗯啾。”"}, "length": {"chs": 4, "steam": 5}, "similarity": 0.5}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6772", "steam": "sn6772", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「唔嗯、嗯嗯……？！啾、啾、唔唔、\\n　啾……啾唔、嗯嗯、唔……唔……♪」", "steam": "“呼嗯、嗯嗯……！？啾、啾咕、嗯嗯、啾……啾姆、嗯嗯、嗯……唔唔……♪”"}, "length": {"chs": 37, "steam": 36}, "similarity": 0.75}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6773", "steam": "sn6773", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「哈……亲、亲过头啦，笨蛋……诶嘿嘿」", "steam": "“哈……太、太快了、笨蛋……嘿嘿嘿。”"}, "length": {"chs": 19, "steam": 19}, "similarity": 0.5}
