{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "停止接吻之后，纱凪露出无比开心的表情\\n把脸靠向了我。", "steam": "嘴唇才刚分开，纱凪就笑得一脸开心，蹭了蹭我的脸。"}, "length": {"chs": 27, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.348}
