{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6786", "steam": "sn6786", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……那、那干脆……如果，\\n　你愿意的话，要不……」", "steam": "“……那、那么，干脆……那个、新吾愿意的话……”"}, "length": {"chs": 27, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.581}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6787", "steam": "sn6787", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「一起待到……早上……？」", "steam": "“到早上……都在一起吧……？”"}, "length": {"chs": 13, "steam": 15}, "similarity": 0.714}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "……瞬间，我陷入了思考。", "steam": "……我犹豫了一秒。"}, "length": {"chs": 12, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.286}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "不过，纱凪眼里明确流露出了强烈的渴望。", "steam": "但是纱凪的眼神中散发着强烈的希望。"}, "length": {"chs": 19, "steam": 17}, "similarity": 0.424}
