{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6790", "steam": "sn6790", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「这些小细节就别管了，\\n　在睡醒之前都是今天」", "steam": "“不用管那种细节啦，到睡着醒来之前都算今天。”"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 23}, "similarity": 0.513}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6791", "steam": "sn6791", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「因为是平安夜，这些事都是能被原谅的」", "steam": "“因为是平安夜，所以全部都是被允许的。”"}, "length": {"chs": 19, "steam": 20}, "similarity": 0.625}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "……纱凪的心里，\\n似乎也有着平安夜的魔法。", "steam": "……在纱凪心中，平安夜似乎是有魔法的样子。"}, "length": {"chs": 22, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.686}
