{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「啊哈哈……抱歉抱歉、看见纱凪这么可爱忍不住就」", "steam": "“啊哈哈……抱歉抱歉，因为纱凪太可爱了。”"}, "length": {"chs": 24, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.629}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6794", "steam": "sn6794", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「毕竟是平安夜，我就原谅你吧……♪」", "steam": "“因为是平安夜，所以原谅你……♪”"}, "length": {"chs": 18, "steam": 17}, "similarity": 0.64}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6795", "steam": "sn6795", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「啊、疼疼疼」", "steam": "“啊、好痛痛痛。”"}, "length": {"chs": 7, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.364}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「嗯……为了你能好受一些，\\n　无论多少次……我都会温柔地对待你的」", "steam": "“嗯……为了能尽量减缓疼痛，不管几次……我会温柔的。”"}, "length": {"chs": 34, "steam": 27}, "similarity": 0.444}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6796", "steam": "sn6796", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……嗯♪\\n　圣诞礼物，要给我很多哦……？」", "steam": "“……嗯♪给我很多礼物吧……？”"}, "length": {"chs": 23, "steam": 16}, "similarity": 0.696}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「你这种上挑的眼神也很可爱……\\n　不过，现在能先闭上眼吗？」", "steam": "“虽然那种眼神很可爱……不过，现在闭上眼睛吧？”"}, "length": {"chs": 31, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.619}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6797", "steam": "sn6797", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「嗯……啾、啾♪」", "steam": "“嗯……啾、啾♪”"}, "length": {"chs": 9, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 1.0}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6798", "steam": "sn6798", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「嘿嘿嘿……光是今天一天，亲吻的次数就已经\\n　超过了至今以来的总数呢，感觉脑子里就只剩亲吻了呢……♪」", "steam": "“嘿嘿嘿……感觉光是今天，就超过以前加起来亲亲的次数了……♪”"}, "length": {"chs": 52, "steam": 31}, "similarity": 0.627}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6799", "steam": "sn6799", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「今晚，在各种意义上都是一生难忘……\\n　嘿嘿、哎嘿嘿……」", "steam": "“在各种意义上都是一辈子难忘的夜晚……嘿嘿、欸嘿嘿……”"}, "length": {"chs": 30, "steam": 28}, "similarity": 0.773}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6800", "steam": "sn6800", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「……新吾，你觉得怎么样？\\n　是不是也觉得……今天晚上和我在一起，一生难忘？」", "steam": "“……新吾呢？跟我一样……一辈子都忘不了今晚吗？”"}, "length": {"chs": 40, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.435}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": "新吾", "steam": "新吾"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "新吾"}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "「怎么可能会忘啊」", "steam": "“怎么可能忘记。”"}, "length": {"chs": 9, "steam": 9}, "similarity": 0.769}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "——对。今天发生的事情，\\n在各种意义上都难以忘记。", "steam": "──没错，在各种意义上今天都是让人无法忘记的一天。"}, "length": {"chs": 26, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.522}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "也不能忘记。", "steam": "不可能忘记。"}, "length": {"chs": 6, "steam": 6}, "similarity": 0.8}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6801", "steam": "sn6801", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「哈哈……成功了！\\n　也让新吾为我神魂颠倒了一回♪～」", "steam": "“啊哈……太好了！把新吾迷得神魂颠倒～♪”"}, "length": {"chs": 28, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.526}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6802", "steam": "sn6802", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「哼、嘻嘻嘻嘻……哈～\\n　好开心、好幸福啊……」", "steam": "“嗯呼、嗯优嗯优嗯优……哈～太高兴了、太幸福了……”"}, "length": {"chs": 25, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.316}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "纱凪微笑着，在我眼中真是无比可爱、惹人怜爱。", "steam": "笑着这么说的纱凪真的好可爱、好惹人怜爱。"}, "length": {"chs": 22, "steam": 20}, "similarity": 0.615}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "所以我，满怀爱意抱紧了她，\\n无数次地吻她、摸她的头，让她高兴。", "steam": "所以我抱紧她，一次又一次地亲吻、抚摸头发取悦她。"}, "length": {"chs": 32, "steam": 24}, "similarity": 0.52}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "page": 0, "status": "aligned", "speaker": {"chs": "纱凪", "steam": "紗凪"}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": "纱凪"}, "voice": {"chs": "sn6803", "steam": "sn6803", "equal": true}, "text": {"chs": "「嗯嗯……♪呼、呼呼呼、嘻嘻嘻嘻～……」", "steam": "“嗯嗯……♪呵呵、呵呵呵、嗯优嗯优嗯优～”"}, "length": {"chs": 20, "steam": 21}, "similarity": 0.387}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "然后，纱凪的身体似乎也在说着“我还要”一般，\\n更加紧贴着我……", "steam": "于是纱凪的身体便亲密地贴上来，像在要求‘更多’……"}, "length": {"chs": 32, "steam": 25}, "similarity": 0.391}
{"script": "１２月２４日（木）_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "page": 0, "status": "needs_review", "speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "alt_speaker": {"chs": null, "steam": null}, "voice": {"chs": null, "steam": null, "equal": false}, "text": {"chs": "我们就这样紧贴着，\\n睡到了早上……", "steam": "在直到天亮为止的短暂时间中，我们依偎着彼此入睡了……"}, "length": {"chs": 18, "steam": 26}, "similarity": 0.316}
